/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/totalitarianism-in-one-city-shreveports.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5687606400677284777' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5687606400677284777' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 3, 2009 at 1:23 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5140355215008699226</id><published>2009-07-02T21:22:19.655-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-02T21:22:19.655-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Doctor Mike: Judging by your spelling, punctuation...</title><content type='html'>Doctor Mike: Judging by your spelling, punctuation, and capitalization errors, I’d say you are a cop and not a Physician as you claim. You are totally illiterate, which is all too common in cops but unusual in Physicians at the level you display. Take two of anything and call me in the morning.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5687606400677284777/comments/default/5140355215008699226'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5687606400677284777/comments/default/5140355215008699226'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/totalitarianism-in-one-city-shreveports.html?showComment=1246591339655#c5140355215008699226' title=''/><author><name>I Hate Bobby Flay</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/totalitarianism-in-one-city-shreveports.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blo